                    <h3>Access</h3>
                    <dl class="console-definition-list">
                        <dt>Anonymous access</dt><dd>Inherit (public read)</dd>
                        <dt>Owner_name (PII)</dt><dd><span class="console-status console-state-warning">hidden in this slot</span></dd>
                        <dt>Max record count</dt><dd>Inherit (5,000)</dd>
                    </dl>
                </article>
                <p class="publish-callout publish-callout-info">Public read exposes every non-hidden attribute. The PII-flagged owner_name stays redacted in this slot.</p>
            </div>
            <aside class="publish-wizard-rail">
                <p class="publish-callout publish-callout-info">Access defaults come from the resource. Override per-slot only when this layer must differ.</p>
